      "value": "@{62b608e7a0f911251a019196|full_name} But that's yet another contradiction. In order for persona to know that it had already been used they would have to have been storing it. And if they're using it for that check then they can't let you delete it or it would make the check pointless. So either they're storing it forever and they check for reuse, or you can delete it. You can't have both.",
